---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Amierul Faiz" description="My journey, education background, and what I’m focusing on." >
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">My Journey & Education</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
        A quick story of where I started, what I’m learning now, and how my education supports my goal in cybersecurity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">My Journey</h2>
        <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-7">
          <p>
            I am a university student and aspiring cybersecurity professional with a background in electronic network design.
            I focus on SOC, penetration testing, and ethical hacking.
          </p>
          <p>
            I’m building toward a career in threat detection and vulnerability research—moving step-by-step from lab learning to real-world security thinking.
          </p>
          <p>
            Current focus: secure access control, practical network security, and incident-focused reasoning.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Education</h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Bachelor of Electronic Engineering Technology (Electronic Network Design) with honours</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Sep 2023 to Nov 2027</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">CGPA: 3.72</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/70 p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Diploma in Computer Engineering</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Aug 2020 to Apr 2023</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300">Honors and Awards: Program Ijazah Dalam Negara (PIDN), JPA Scholar</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

